    {
      "id": 7895,
      "nameEs": "Shockman",
      "originalName": "Shockman",
      "year": 1991,
      "igdbId": 42098,
      "popularity": 0,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "best_version",
          "value": "15991",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "Shockman",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Shockman",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "It's been two years since Arnold and Sonya were made into Shockmen. A message from the professor to return to their bodies has them head to his laboratory, but they are ambushed by a mysterious enemy along the way. After narrowly defeating the enemy, they catch a TV news flash announcing the Ryo Empire invasion. They find that the professor has been abducted and set out to rescue him.\n\nShockman is a side-view action shooter that has eight stages, including Action Stages, where you jump and use special techniques, and side-scrolling Shooting Stages. This game expands on the well-paced story from the previous version and contains cooperative elements like shared life and a powerful Team Shockbeam that can be used during two-player simultaneous play.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Han pasado dos años desde que Arnold y Sonya se convirtieron en Shockmen. Un mensaje del profesor para que regresen a sus cuerpos los lleva a su laboratorio, pero en el camino son emboscados por un enemigo misterioso. Tras derrotar apenas al enemigo, ven un avance de noticias en la televisión que anuncia la invasión del Imperio Ryo. Descubren que el profesor ha sido secuestrado y se disponen a rescatarlo.\n\nShockman es un shooter de acción con vista lateral que tiene ocho fases, incluidas las Action Stages, donde saltas y usas técnicas especiales, y las Shooting Stages de desplazamiento lateral. Este juego amplía la historia bien ritmada de la versión anterior e incluye elementos cooperativos, como la vida compartida y un poderoso Team Shockbeam que puede usarse en el modo simultáneo para dos jugadores.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1991",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
